  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6802.01 Criteria for Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6802.01 Criteria for Approval.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 265-A:15,II, the commissioner shall approve the preliminary breath test device by manufacturer make and model in accordance with (b) below.\n\n(b) The criteria to be used for approval of a preliminary breath test device shall be the following:\n\n(1) The device shall be identified on the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration’s “Conforming Products List” of evidential breath measurement devices;\n\n(2) The device shall be capable of analyzing a series of samples using a simulator or dry gas standard at known alcohol concentrations; and\n\n(3) The device, submitted in accordance with Saf-C 6802.02, shall successfully pass the protocol for evaluation of preliminary breath test devices in accordance with Saf-C 6802.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6800) #9685, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12518, eff 4-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6800.html"
